 class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">いま</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">今</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いま</span><span class=\"k-wz\">现在；当下；此刻；立即；马上；再；又；还</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">今日</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">今天</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">今朝</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けさ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">今天早上；今晨</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">九</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/kanji/\">N5</a>九</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キュウ・ク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ここの・ここの.つ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">九</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">九；数字九</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">九日</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ここのか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">每月九日；九号；九天</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">九つ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ここのつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">九；九岁；十二点（旧时制）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">入</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/kanji/\">N5</a>进入；插入；放入</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ニュウ・ジュ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">い.る・-い.る・-い.り・い.れる・-い.れ・はい.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">入口</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いりぐち</span><span class=\"k-wz\">入口；门口；出入口；通道；关口</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">入る</span><span class=\"